# Leaning out round a corner (the manual aim, stage 3): at a corner of a house in the city's harbour (`corner`: a
# wall in front of the head, open ahead leaning out), the bow up aiming straight ahead, the side step held: the
# trunk leans out, the camera goes with it (over the left shoulder to the left). From the game's camera and
# from behind
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
give ItRw_Arrow 100
stats str 60 dex 60 bow 60
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_09
wait 500
corner right go 5
tap bow
wait 1500
aimat ahead 2000 150
cam game
wait 300
rec right_game
press action
wait 900
hold right 3000
wait 3300
release action
wait 1500
stop
cam follow 230 120 180
cam look 140
wait 300
rec right_behind
press action
wait 900
hold right 2500
wait 2800
release action
wait 1500
stop

goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_09
wait 500
corner left go 4
wait 800
aimat ahead 2000 150
cam game
wait 300
rec left_game
press action
wait 900
hold left 3000
wait 3300
release action
wait 1500
stop
cam follow 230 120 180
cam look 140
wait 300
rec left_behind
press action
wait 900
hold left 2500
wait 2800
release action
wait 1500
stop
